egin="00:42.476" end="00:43.309">Because </span><span begin="00:43.309" end="00:43.693">of </span><span begin="00:43.693" end="00:43.965">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.205" end="00:49.309"><span begin="00:44.205" end="00:44.589">I </span><span begin="00:44.589" end="00:44.974">never </span><span begin="00:44.974" end="00:45.933">stray </span><span begin="00:45.933" end="00:46.317">too </span><span begin="00:46.317" end="00:46.700">far </span><span begin="00:46.700" end="00:46.877">from </span><span begin="00:46.877" end="00:47.135">the </span><span begin="00:47.135" end="00:48.844">sidewalk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.309" end="00:50.838"><span begin="00:49.309" end="00:50.149">Because </span><span begin="00:50.149" end="00:50.454">of </span><span begin="00:50.454" end="00:50.661">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.838" end="00:56.149"><span begin="00:50.838" end="00:50.998">I </span><span begin="00:50.998" end="00:51.174">learned </span><span begin="00:51.174" end="00:51.430">to </span><span begin="00:51.430" end="00:51.894">play </span><span begin="00:51.894" end="00:52.086">on </span><span begin="00:52.086" end="00:52.326">the </span><span begin="00:52.326" end="00:52.677">safe </span><span begin="00:52.677" end="00:53.158">side </span><span begin="00:53.158" end="00:53.349">so </span><span begin="00:53.349" end="00:53.830">I </span><span begin="00:53.830" end="00:54.214">don't </span><span begin="00:54.214" end="00:54.614">get </span><span begin="00:54.614" end="00:55.541">hurt</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.149" end="00:57.822"><span begin="00:56.149" end="00:57.068">Because </span><span begin="00:57.068" end="00:57.340">of </span><span begin="00:57.340" end="00:57.614">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.822" end="01:03.396"><span begin="00:57.822" end="00:58.014">I </span><span begin="00:58.014" end="00:58.190">find </span><span begin="00:58.190" end="00:58.382">it </span><span begin="00:58.382" end="00